      <p begin="00:27.480" end="00:30.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Uh (uh), yuh (yuh), yuh (yuh)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.500" end="00:32.630" ttm:agent="v1">Got scars on the wrist like yuh</p>
